  "body": "I turned on presence again on my server, which then promptly tried to send presence updates to all the servers. It then proceeded to wedge for over 10 minutes, at which point I restarted.\r\n\r\nDuring that time I got the following pyflame:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8428120/55806641-92922d80-5ad8-11e9-9055-6eec544c7277.png)\r\n\r\n(Full version: https://jki.re/_matrix/media/v1/download/jki.re/RONFxDxvbgPVuzuUeNHMpsfy/flame.svg)\r\n\r\nThis shows synapse spending all of its time in `twisted.names.client`, i.e. doing DNS queries. (Further pyflames show the same result, so its not just a blip).",
